<!-- Phase 1 modularization: the unified app's manifest shell.

     The r59 unified overlay's job (declaring the editor's two contract
     launch activities on the unified applicationId with FULL class names,
     WITHOUT the edit app's INTERNET strip) is now done by the manifest
     MERGE itself: :unified:app depends on :editor:core, whose library
     manifest declares the activities with full names and carries no strip
     directive. The gallery half (permissions, queries, application
     attributes, the launcher alias) arrives from :gallery:core's library
     manifest. This shell is deliberately empty. -->
